      "note": "Sources differ on timing: the 1400s and 1500s for Luo groups entering Uganda (Encyclopedia.com, Uganda), the 16th century for a major wave (African History Extra), and 1550-1700 for Luo immigrants in Busoga (Encyclopedia.com, Basoga). The Kenya entry says \"over the past 500 years\". The id year 1500 follows the Bunyoro tradition."
